uild, owned by Doe Pics Hit, Inc., raised nearly $9 million, according to FactSet, with the most recent fundraising in May 2016. Buddybuild did not disclose the terms of the sale. Apple stock is up 49% over the past year, as the S&P 500 index rose 20%. The Dow Jones Industrial Average , of which Apple is a component, rose 25% over the past year.\n-Max A. Cherney;\n 1724ET\n ", "external_links": ["http://www.addthis.com/bookmark.php?v=250", "https://www.buddybuild.com/blog/buddybuild-is-now-part-of-apple)"], "published": "2018-01-02T02:00:00.000+02:00", "crawled": "2018-01-03T00:32:34.034+02:00", "highlightTitle": ""}